1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,730
Slide 35 illustrates "BALANCING AUTONOMY AND CONTROL: The 3-Tier Execution Matrix."

2
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:18,320
Card 1: "TIER 1: FULL AUTONOMY" for read-only research, web crawling, data aggregation, and drafting internal notes.

3
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:26,470
Card 2: "TIER 2: NOTIFY & LOG" for internal drafting, format conversion, and committing code to staging branches.

4
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:38,290
And Card 3: "TIER 3: STRICT HUMAN APPROVAL" for external financial transfers, client-facing emails, production database migrations, or file deletions.

5
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:47,780
This ensures that an avatar can summarize 50 research papers without asking permission, but cannot send an external business contract without human review.

6
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:57,250
Tier 3 operations trigger instant interactive push notifications to your mobile phone with complete contextual diffs and one-tap approval buttons.

7
00:00:58,150 --> 00:01:05,880
This 3-tier matrix eliminates catastrophic operational accidents while maximizing day-to-day productivity.

